{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{Z} \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{X}$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-immersion}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:7a7cf25a2fc50f8d8ad17c552b076ee86b97b5f0d2d2b7155de6c7482cb00c00", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:42046e18a9b6584e95e7880cd29ed64a32ecdea22fff83efeb814beb478febf9", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a\n(closed, resp.<SPACE_0001>open) immersion.\nThen <MATH_0003>\nis a (closed, resp.<SPACE_0002>open) immersion.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7fd226425543d5a78481f8a2dc6becf5598e1a880219e59437e63ff60a2f173b", "unit_id": "tag:0501:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:10c8115c34509d04b7176a93679519db571a67cadec4f8488692f6727328203f", "source_text": "This follows from the general discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d668f41f0ac978d34c17ad6dd649034d78b29e73ee93446da7d3ce9097aeb7f6", "unit_id": "tag:0501:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-immersion}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:635648c39ea088ceacd789087009fe976671ef4a17286158d90c49f0d02eae67", "source_text": "Compositions of immersions of algebraic stacks are immersions.\nSimilarly for closed immersions and open immersions.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:ab9624375e16f0ee8040ee9a2602dcd93952a1eff56a2a9b944334d667dd03f3", "unit_id": "tag:0502:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{spaces-lemma-composition-immersions}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c94582d3d09c203e5d4fa5eb64f7906ad732677c97a5d6ec1ec2fdf558196c24", "source_text": "This follows from the general discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>\nand\nSpaces, Lemma <REF_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:1535ca5096f192ef275d62b495de6f3aa612d72f130f5d51300383f1c4d93cac", "unit_id": "tag:0502:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$W$", "MATH_0003": "$W \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$V = W \\times_\\mathcal{Y} \\mathcal{X}$", "MATH_0006": "$V \\to W$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ ", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-check-immersion-covering}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:6243442390cc038ac9a7f0cdeffdabfc8bfc1fb185665ea679b552fb7ca60a71", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:82004bf179bfdf06bf3b4491375ee74ac0df57fbfc7352a6c24fb60c051463df", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of algebraic stacks.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an algebraic space and let <MATH_0003> be a surjective,\nflat morphism which is locally of finite presentation. The following\nare equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is an (open, resp.<SPACE_0001>closed) immersion, and\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005> is an algebraic space, and\n<MATH_0006> is an (open, resp.<SPACE_0002>closed) immersion.\n<STRUCT_0004>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:682335b179c39a8a9a67c3f162c699ba8f95738d4c0c0ca59d872d0a423d9b80", "unit_id": "tag:0503:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{section-properties-morphisms}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-check-representable-covering}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-check-property-covering}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:601ebfd1d7cdfca00dfaa7111b80159c56cd12c85f45661685fd80c1aa6fb84b", "source_text": "This follows from the general discussion in\nSection <REF_0001>\nand in particular\nLemmas <REF_0002> and\n<REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:306e907bbb3358d334c897aaa048ece2992385b09428d9b3e59ef5fa21300dfd", "unit_id": "tag:0503:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-immersion-monomorphism}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1a04d552b0a53a96da6e2ebc2369adfe380ea38b2a92721b9dfaf6eddb37ffaf", "source_text": "An immersion is a monomorphism.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:85d2079fc532d859b335e401083da3e0bea9268f6e7472ab91a1c6d16adef484", "unit_id": "tag:0504:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{spaces-morphisms-lemma-immersions-monomorphisms}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8861ad9fb154532f473b0023e1497ba0d0b88f6adcb6da41848a3507766267d4", "source_text": "See\nMorphisms of Spaces,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c970175252f3a693478f247d3ea7cd976b41825c7830fd361c0af51d03edae39", "unit_id": "tag:0504:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : \\mathcal{X} \\to \\mathcal{Y}$", "MATH_0002": "$|f| : |\\mathcal{X}| \\to |\\mathcal{Y}|$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$|f|$", "SPACE_0001": "\\ ", "SPACE_0002": "\\ "}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-subspace-induced-topology}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4ddf2eddb4a5b98bc47542e135e0e4d554ee195dade1a29ea2d21033f4764f6f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:14ac51308fe7f8f3d4d0cfa989945560b15201ebdeea22e8fe2757ebef3f7aa9", "source_text": "If <MATH_0001> is an immersion, then\n<MATH_0002> is a homeomorphism\nonto a locally closed subset. If <MATH_0003> is a closed, resp.<SPACE_0001>open\nimmersion, then <MATH_0004> is closed, resp.<SPACE_0002>open.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f2570f0b983def9c8ca5ff1ce27ca4ea6742b1c60173e42d1d30fefd99c02c97", "unit_id": "tag:0H20:statement"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1ff65b2b9a88cfb418d375458634b3baf22c56b3869ce8dad5b19d7407861792", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:0H20:proof"}
{"chapter": "stacks-properties", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04YK", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e708ff49135e162d207aa2d0346704778e9d8c0acae311c0a940fafcbe948abf", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nThe following two lemmas explain how to think about\nimmersions in terms of presentations.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:4f5ce0d3f7ea677cba2a702babbf085484116bb538cd19a91e699e933d7cab4b", "unit_id": "tag:04YK:prose-0003"}
